@startuml
title 戦旗水滸伝 v10 OO再設計 - 統合レビュー反映版
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package Boundary {
  interface BattleCommandPort
  interface BattlePresentationPort
  interface BattleCheckpointPort
}

package Application {
  class Game
  class StageFactory
  class SaveService
  class SaveRepository
  class SaveCodec
  class SaveMigrator
  class MigrationCatalog
  class SaveCheckpointAdapter
}

package Audio {
  class AudioController
  class BattleAudioSession
  class AudioAssetCatalog
  class AudioCueMapper
}

package Presentation {
  class BattleScreen
  class BattleRenderer
  class BattleEffectManager
  class BattleVisualEffectSession
  class BattleVisualAssetCatalog
  class DialogueController
  class BattleView
  class BattleViewFactory
  class PersistencePanel
}

package Orchestration {
  class BattleController
  class BattleSession
  class BattleSessionFactory
  class BattleSessionHost
  class BattleRandom
  class MovementService
  class CombatService
  class TacticService
  class StatusService
  class AIService
}

package Domain {
  class Stage
  class BattleMap
  class MapCell
  class Terrain
  class TerrainCatalog
  class Unit
  class Character
  class CharacterManager
  class Army
  class ArmyManager
  class StageEventManager
  class ObjectiveManager
  class SpeechManager
  class DialogueManager
  class Speech
  class Dialogue
  class HiddenTrap
  class BattleLog
  class UnitControlRule
  class StageAIConfig
  class WideIllusionAIRule
  class PursuitAIRule
  class TargetPriorityAIRule
}

package Events {
  class ReinforcementEvent
  class BetrayalEvent
  class MissionTransitionEvent
  class DialogueEvent
}

package Objectives {
  class EliminationObjective
  class ReachObjective
  class UnitDefeatObjective
  class TurnLimitObjective
  class SurviveUntilTurnObjective
}

package DTO {
  class ActionQueryContext <<DTO>>
  class PresentationRequest <<DTO>>
  class CombatResult <<DTO>>
  class TacticResult <<DTO>>
  class PreparedBattleLoad <<DTO>>
  class BattleSaveData <<DTO>>
  class BattleResult <<DTO>>
}

Game --> CharacterManager
Game --> TerrainCatalog
Game --> StageFactory
Game --> SaveService
Game --> AudioController
Game --> BattleSessionFactory : create candidate
Game --> BattleSessionHost : transactional swap
Game --> PersistencePanel : 20 slots / Repair UI
Game --> SaveCheckpointAdapter

BattleSessionHost *-- BattleSession
BattleSession --> BattleController
BattleSession --> BattleScreen
BattleSession --> BattleRandom
BattleSession --> BattleView
BattleSessionFactory --> BattleViewFactory
BattleSessionFactory --> BattleController
BattleSessionFactory --> BattleScreen
BattleSessionFactory --> AudioController : create BattleAudioSession
BattleViewFactory --> BattleView

BattleController ..|> BattleCommandPort
BattleScreen --> BattleCommandPort : query / command
BattleScreen ..|> BattlePresentationPort
BattleController --> BattlePresentationPort : present(request, signal)
SaveCheckpointAdapter ..|> BattleCheckpointPort
SaveCheckpointAdapter --> SaveService
BattleController --> BattleCheckpointPort : stable snapshot

BattleScreen *-- BattleRenderer
BattleScreen *-- BattleEffectManager
BattleScreen *-- DialogueController
BattleEffectManager *-- BattleVisualEffectSession
BattleEffectManager *-- BattleAudioSession
BattleVisualEffectSession --> BattleVisualAssetCatalog
BattleVisualEffectSession --> Stage : read-only layout
BattleAudioSession --> AudioController
AudioController --> AudioAssetCatalog
AudioController --> AudioCueMapper
DialogueController --> Dialogue : runtime ref

BattleController --> Stage
BattleController --> BattleRandom
BattleController --> MovementService
BattleController --> CombatService
BattleController --> TacticService
BattleController --> StatusService
BattleController --> AIService
BattleController ..> ActionQueryContext
BattleController ..> PresentationRequest
BattleController ..> BattleSaveData : stable snapshot
BattleController ..> BattleResult : completion promise

MovementService --> Stage : read-only query
CombatService --> Unit : atomic mutation
TacticService --> Unit : atomic mutation
StatusService --> Unit : status only
CombatService ..> CombatResult
TacticService ..> TacticResult

AIService --> MovementService : read-only
AIService --> CombatService : read-only API
AIService --> TacticService : read-only API
AIService --> BattleRandom : confirmed decision only

Stage *-- BattleMap
Stage *-- ArmyManager
Stage *-- StageEventManager
Stage *-- ObjectiveManager
Stage *-- SpeechManager
Stage *-- DialogueManager
Stage *-- HiddenTrap
Stage *-- BattleLog
Stage *-- UnitControlRule
Stage *-- StageAIConfig
Stage o-- Unit : unitsById / unitOrder
Stage o-- Character : mobCharacters
Speech --> Character
Dialogue o-- Speech
DialogueManager o-- Dialogue

BattleMap *-- MapCell
MapCell --> Terrain
MapCell --> Unit : actual occupant
Unit --> Character
ArmyManager *-- Army
Army o-- Unit

StageAIConfig o-- Unit : resolved refs
StageAIConfig *-- WideIllusionAIRule
StageAIConfig *-- PursuitAIRule
StageAIConfig *-- TargetPriorityAIRule

StageEventManager o-- ReinforcementEvent
StageEventManager o-- BetrayalEvent
StageEventManager o-- MissionTransitionEvent
StageEventManager o-- DialogueEvent

ObjectiveManager o-- EliminationObjective
ObjectiveManager o-- ReachObjective
ObjectiveManager o-- UnitDefeatObjective
ObjectiveManager o-- TurnLimitObjective
ObjectiveManager o-- SurviveUntilTurnObjective

StageFactory --> CharacterManager
StageFactory --> TerrainCatalog
StageFactory --> Stage

SaveService --> SaveRepository
SaveService --> SaveCodec
SaveService --> SaveMigrator
SaveService --> StageFactory
SaveService ..> PreparedBattleLoad
SaveMigrator --> MigrationCatalog

note right of BattleMap
位置の唯一の正本。
Previewは入れない。
外部へはPosition値を返す。
end note

note right of MovementService
query / validationのみ。
moveUnitはBattleControllerが
BattleMapへ指示する。
end note

note right of BattlePresentationPort
DOM・asset IDを含まない
意味要求だけを渡す。
Battleごとにabort可能。
end note

note right of AudioController
BGMとWeb Audio graphを共有する。
初回user gestureでunlockし、
visibility changeでsuspend/resumeする。
end note

note right of BattleAudioSession
Battle固有の一時音を所有する。
dispose後は再生中音源を停止し、
遅延decode完了後も再生しない。
end note

note right of BattleVisualEffectSession
盤面と分離したBattle専用overlayを所有する。
意味要求だけから画像演出へ写像し、
Abort／disposeでDOMとtimerを全除去する。
end note

note right of StageEventManager
Definition順のfixed-point連鎖。
interruptMovementでは止めず、
Battle terminal時だけ停止する。
end note

note bottom of SaveService
decode -> migrate -> create Stage
-> restore -> validate -> prepare
-> 新session接続検証
-> 成功後だけBattleを交換。
Repairは正常fallbackと三世代guardを再検査する。
v10専用namespaceのみを使用。
end note

note bottom of SaveRepository
primary / temporary / backupを所有する。
fallback昇格もlockと実データ比較を通し、
途中失敗時は正常copyを最低1世代残す。
end note

note bottom of BattleSessionHost
candidateはdetached DOMで接続検証する。
表示rootへactivate後に旧sessionをdisposeし、
新規開始またはLoad再開だけを実行する。
end note

note bottom of BattleController
startNewBattleは初期化を行う。
resumeLoadedBattleは保存済みphaseを再開し、
PHASE_STARTやstatus減算を再実行しない。
unexpected errorはFAULTEDで停止する。
end note
@enduml
